  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-Kiribati Partnership - Safe and sustainable drinking water for Kiritimati Island - SPC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Action is part of the larger programme: EU-Kiribati Partnership for a sustainable and inclusive socio-economic development. The overall objective is to support Kiribati in building greater socio-economic and climate resilience. The Specific objective is to improve the use of services and goods provided by the public sector with a focus on water and sanitation in the Line Islands. This CA covers 1 out of 4 components of the broader Partnership:Component 2  Safe and sustainable drinking waterExpected results for the SPC components:1. Improved evidence-based management of water resources;  2. Increased access to safe and reliable drinking water supply; and3. Strengthened capacity to operate, maintain and manage safe efficient and accountable water supply systems.</narrative>
  </description>
